# The DS18B20 of the temperature builds (configs/temperature.patch): the two sensors of
# temperatureSensing in config.h, on D3. Appended to the board files of check-temp and
# check-new-temp: their datalog must report each temperature, read after its conversion.
ds18b20 3 21.5 28 BE 41 6B 09 00 00 A4
ds18b20 3 -3.25 28 1B D7 6A 09 00 00 B7
expect ds18b20_early_reads 0
expect temperature 1 21.5 21.5
expect temperature 2 -3.25 -3.25
